#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-subscriptions.php
msgid "Plans of companies and professionals (limits on listings, tonnage, buildings, service pages, completed projects, quotation answers, AI credits, visible contacts, featured), AI credit packs and paid listing options. Payment outside the site (transfer, CCP, BaridiMob, cheque) with proof of payment, activated by the platform team, with an invoice. Founding members offer. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""

